{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"带着对那种生活的牵挂继续往前，他反倒觉得它离自己近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"离自己近了\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"从前他一怕争取会磨掉那种亲近，就想退回安宁，可珍惜的东西仍会继续受损。\",\n      \"key\": \"继续受损\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"想到眼前的事也是为了那种生活，舍不得反倒推着他往前，心里也有了股劲。\",\n      \"key\": \"推着他往前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他往前时也会想，这样拼命会不会磨掉温柔，最后还换不回那种生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"想到那种生活，他又高兴起来，心里有了安慰，也照样做眼前的事，不靠忙碌压住想念。\",\n      \"key\": \"不靠忙碌压住想念\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他还不知道努力能护住多少，也不肯因愿望没成，就说从前的安宁不算数。\",\n      \"key\": \"安宁不算数\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他不必再硬撑证明自己该往前，仍清楚自己想护住那种生活，往后累了也可能想退。\",\n      \"key\": \"证明自己该往前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R66\", \"R67\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\", \"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧愿在带着牵挂行动时更亲近，以及过去想退回安宁来保护它、后来发现退回来仍挡不住损害的前因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R68\", \"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"用眼前的事正是为了那种生活，说明依恋如何变成行动理由；两边能一起推动他，但不宣告冲突永远消失。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的行动原则改成具体顾虑：拼命可能磨掉温柔，仍未必换回所愿。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧日快乐回返，写成他允许安慰存在、继续做事而不压下想念，不替人物宣布领悟。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留结果未知和愿望未成，同时明确不因此抹掉曾有的安宁。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R74\", \"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留以后会累、可能想退，也保留不必靠硬撑证明自己；让结尾的心意清楚，但不保证永不动摇。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R75\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\", \"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把不互相取消的原则落到两处具体做法：心里有安慰仍做事，愿望未成也不说旧日安宁不算数。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\", \"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"去掉抽象的价值判断，保留其依据：争取可能磨损温柔，愿望未成也不能抹掉曾经的安宁。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ed871dd7-8671-466d-b09a-bbd6052e5d5a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T211702651855Z", "elapsed_seconds": 798.11, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T21:30:20.769619+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4f02f478939864fddd00d3101f6553f07bedeefa435b09d7a848ce88cfd27a0b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": fal